    "created_at": "2020-10-30T04:06:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-10-30T04:06:09Z",
    "body": "...well, I found the reason for this. Docker environment runs with `POSIX` locale, which doesn't handle UTF-8. Once I set the locale to `C.UTF-8`, the mangling is gone. Should have thought about this earlier :D\r\n\r\nOn a more practical note - the documentation mentions that you need an UTF-8 enabled locale [here](https://starship.rs/faq/#why-don-t-i-see-a-glyph-symbol-in-my-prompt) but I glossed over that, as the prompt itself displayed _fine_. Maybe it's worth adding a general note in the installation section that you need to check if your locale is sane?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
